## Root cause
`padStart` in `/luxon/src/impl/util.js` padded the *string form of the signed number*:

```js
export function padStart(input, n = 2) {
  if (input.toString().length < n) {
    return ("0".repeat(n) + input).slice(-n);   // "-1" -> "00-1" -> slice(-4) -> "00-1"
  } else {
    return input.toString();
  }
}
```

